=3D"style-module-scss-module__nbagBW__learnContent"><header><h1>Shift Zeros=
 to the End</h1></header><div class=3D"style-module-scss-module__ubvNPq__pr=
oblemDescription"><p>Given an array of integers, modify the array in place =
to <strong>move all zeros to the end</strong> while maintaining the relativ=
e order of non-zero elements.</p><h4 id=3D"example">Example:</h4><pre><code=
 class=3D"hljs language-python">Input: nums =3D [<span class=3D"hljs-number=
">0</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-numbe=
r">0</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-number">3</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-numb=
